sentences.text:
9. Let the applicant- Monu Singh be released on bail in Case Crime No. 321 of 2022 under Sections 498A, 304B I.P.C. and Section 3/4 of Dowry Prohibition Prohibition Act, registered at Police Station Atrauli, District Hardoi, on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to the following conditions: -
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

